      obligation IS A `Obligation in another goods contract`
      relied IS A `What is relied on`
      reasonable IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      reach IS A `Reach of a section`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 7(3) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing otherwise than as consumer, the liability in subsection (2)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`s 7(3) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` consumer obligation relied reach EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (3) does not reach this case, or the section is taken out of the case (the twin `s 7(3) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` answers that)
        THEN NOTHING
        IF reasonable EQUALS JUST TRUE
        -- TRUE-kind (the text says yes in its own words): "can be excluded or restricted by reference to such a term, but only in so far as the term satisfies the requirement of reasonableness" -- the term is shown to satisfy it
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "but only in so far as the term satisfies the requirement of reasonableness" -- the term is not shown to satisfy it (unreasonable, or reasonableness not shown): it is for those claiming that it does to show that it does (s 11(5))
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

GIVEN `subsections (2) to (4) apply` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      consumer IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      obligation IS A `Obligation in another goods contract`
      relied IS A `What is relied on`
      reasonable IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      reach IS A `Reach of a section`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 7(2) and (3) the person can exclude or restrict liability for the correspondence of the goods with description or sample, or their quality or fitness` MEANS
    CONSIDER consumer
    -- Consumer status is given: section 7(2) if consumer, section 7(3) if not.
    WHEN JUST x THEN
        IF x
        THEN `s 7(2) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing as consumer, liability for the correspondence of the goods with description or sample, or their quality or fitness` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` consumer obligation relied reach
        ELSE `s 7(3) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing otherwise than as consumer, the liability in subsection (2)` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` consumer obligation relied reasonable reach
    -- Consumer status is not given: the two subsections give the same answer only if the term is not shown reasonable (both are then JUST FALSE, fork F13).
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF `s 7(2) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing as consumer, liability for the correspondence of the goods with description or sample, or their quality or fitness` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` (JUST TRUE) obligation relied reach
            EQUALS `s 7(3) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing otherwise than as consumer, the liability in subsection (2)` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` (JUST FALSE) obligation relied reasonable reach
        THEN `s 7(2) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing as consumer, liability for the correspondence of the goods with description or sample, or their quality or fitness` `subsections (2) to (4) apply` (JUST TRUE) obligation relied reach
        ELSE NOTHING

